            title: "Bricks and Walls",
            icon: "arcforge:arcforge_furnace_brick_wall",
            description: [
                "The Arcforge Furnace is a 3×3×6 cross-shaped column: 24 Arcforge Furnace Bricks, 24 Arcforge Furnace Brick Walls on the four corners, and one Arcforge Furnace Port (bricks, a blast furnace and iron bars) as its face. Six bricks make six walls.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:arcforge_furnace_bricks}, {item:arcforge:arcforge_furnace_brick_wall}, {item:arcforge:arcforge_furnace_port}"
