            title: "The Arcforge Furnace",
            icon: "arcforge:arcforge_furnace_port",
            description: [
                "Form the column and open the Port. It burns Coal Coke for heat and smelts by temperature: steel at 1,200°C, Tempered at 1,300°C, Hardened at 1,400°C, Arcforged and Graphite at 1,500°C. Every smelt leaves Slag. The Handbook's build view shows it layer by layer.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:arcforge_furnace_port}"
